              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaativura, “Kwakora ndio mwami, kigira kwiga ndi gaali ligali agiligali Yahova Nyasaye winyu yaali niyamala kulaga mutumikiri weve Musa ahe munyi kivala yiki choosi kandi mwiti avandu vosi avamenyi mu lwa muzia imbiri kwingira mucho. Kwakora ndio kigira kwatihiizwa nimunyi ligali. Kwaali mu vuti vwi livamwoyo lietu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
